{
  "book": "helaman",
  "bookName": "Helaman",
  "chapter": 14,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 458.049,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that Samuel, the Lamanite, did prophesy a great many more things",
      "verse": "14:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 6.124,
      "end": 7.61,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which cannot be written.",
      "verse": "14:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.29,
      "end": 10.519,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, he said unto them:",
      "verse": "14:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.699,
      "end": 14.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I give unto you a sign; for five years more cometh,",
      "verse": "14:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.687,
      "end": 21.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, then cometh the Son of God to redeem all those who shall believe on his name.",
      "verse": "14:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 22.147,
      "end": 27.116,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, this will I give unto you for a sign at the time of his coming;",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 27.296,
      "end": 30.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, there shall be great lights in heaven,",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 30.402,
      "end": 35.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that in the night before he cometh there shall be no darkness,",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 35.737,
      "end": 39.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that it shall appear unto man as if it was day.",
      "verse": "14:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 40.179,
      "end": 43.848,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, there shall be one day and a night and a day,",
      "verse": "14:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 44.028,
      "end": 47.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as if it were one day and there were no night;",
      "verse": "14:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 47.18,
      "end": 49.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this shall be unto you for a sign;",
      "verse": "14:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 49.682,
      "end": 54.14,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for ye shall know of the rising of the sun and also of its setting;",
      "verse": "14:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 54.32,
      "end": 59.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they shall know of a surety that there shall be two days and a night;",
      "verse": "14:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 60.073,
      "end": 62.581,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless the night shall not be darkened;",
      "verse": "14:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 62.761,
      "end": 65.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it shall be the night before he is born.",
      "verse": "14:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 65.902,
      "end": 68.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, there shall a new star arise,",
      "verse": "14:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 68.822,
      "end": 71.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "such an one as ye never have beheld;",
      "verse": "14:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 71.278,
      "end": 73.6,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this also shall be a sign unto you.",
      "verse": "14:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 74.28,
      "end": 76.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold this is not all,",
      "verse": "14:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 76.41,
      "end": 79.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there shall be many signs and wonders in heaven.",
      "verse": "14:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 79.923,
      "end": 86.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass that ye shall all be amazed, and wonder, insomuch that ye shall fall to the earth.",
      "verse": "14:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 87.523,
      "end": 92.213,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass that whosoever shall believe on the Son of God,",
      "verse": "14:8",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 92.393,
      "end": 94.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the same shall have everlasting life.",
      "verse": "14:8",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 95.627,
      "end": 103.104,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, thus hath the Lord commanded me, by his angel, that I should come and tell this thing unto you;",
      "verse": "14:9",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 103.284,
      "end": 106.721,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he hath commanded that I should prophesy these things unto you;",
      "verse": "14:9",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 106.901,
      "end": 108.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he hath said unto me:",
      "verse": "14:9",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 109.124,
      "end": 110.657,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Cry unto this people,",
      "verse": "14:9",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 110.837,
      "end": 113.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "repent and prepare the way of the Lord.",
      "verse": "14:9",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 113.746,
      "end": 116.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, because I am a Lamanite,",
      "verse": "14:10",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 116.666,
      "end": 120.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have spoken unto you the words which the Lord hath commanded me,",
      "verse": "14:10",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 120.84,
      "end": 126.227,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because it was hard against you, ye are angry with me and do seek to destroy me,",
      "verse": "14:10",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 126.407,
      "end": 128.915,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have cast me out from among you.",
      "verse": "14:10",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 129.595,
      "end": 131.36,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And ye shall hear my words,",
      "verse": "14:11",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 131.54,
      "end": 135.812,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for, for this intent have I come up upon the walls of this city,",
      "verse": "14:11",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 135.992,
      "end": 139.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye might hear and know of the judgments of God",
      "verse": "14:11",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 139.33,
      "end": 142.488,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which do await you because of your iniquities,",
      "verse": "14:11",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 142.668,
      "end": 146.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also that ye might know the conditions of repentance;",
      "verse": "14:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 146.738,
      "end": 150.778,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also that ye might know of the coming of Jesus Christ,",
      "verse": "14:12",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 150.958,
      "end": 152.305,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Son of God,",
      "verse": "14:12",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 152.485,
      "end": 154.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Father of heaven and of earth,",
      "verse": "14:12",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 155.173,
      "end": 157.727,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Creator of all things from the beginning;",
      "verse": "14:12",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 157.907,
      "end": 161.297,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that ye might know of the signs of his coming,",
      "verse": "14:12",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 161.477,
      "end": 164.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the intent that ye might believe on his name.",
      "verse": "14:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 165.454,
      "end": 167.219,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if ye believe on his name",
      "verse": "14:13",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 167.399,
      "end": 169.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye will repent of all your sins,",
      "verse": "14:13",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 169.715,
      "end": 173.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby ye may have a remission of them through his merits.",
      "verse": "14:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 174.482,
      "end": 177.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, again, another sign I give unto you,",
      "verse": "14:14",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 177.866,
      "end": 179.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, a sign of his death.",
      "verse": "14:14",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 180.171,
      "end": 182.586,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, he surely must die",
      "verse": "14:15",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 182.766,
      "end": 184.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that salvation may come;",
      "verse": "14:15",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 184.618,
      "end": 191.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, it behooveth him and becometh expedient that he dieth, to bring to pass the resurrection of the dead,",
      "verse": "14:15",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 191.392,
      "end": 195.107,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby men may be brought into the presence of the Lord.",
      "verse": "14:15",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 195.787,
      "end": 199.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, behold, this death bringeth to pass the resurrection,",
      "verse": "14:16",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 199.404,
      "end": 204.93,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and redeemeth all mankind from the first death\u2014that spiritual death;",
      "verse": "14:16",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 205.11,
      "end": 206.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for all mankind,",
      "verse": "14:16",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 206.683,
      "end": 210.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "by the fall of Adam being cut off from the presence of the Lord,",
      "verse": "14:16",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 210.346,
      "end": 212.157,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are considered as dead,",
      "verse": "14:16",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 212.337,
      "end": 216.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both as to things temporal and to things spiritual.",
      "verse": "14:16",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 216.732,
      "end": 220.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, the resurrection of Christ redeemeth mankind,",
      "verse": "14:17",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 220.395,
      "end": 222.16,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even all mankind,",
      "verse": "14:17",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 222.34,
      "end": 225.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bringeth them back into the presence of the Lord.",
      "verse": "14:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 226.224,
      "end": 229.661,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and it bringeth to pass the condition of repentance,",
      "verse": "14:18",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 229.841,
      "end": 234.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that whosoever repenteth the same is not hewn down and cast into the fire;",
      "verse": "14:18",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 234.758,
      "end": 239.077,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but whosoever repenteth not is hewn down and cast into the fire;",
      "verse": "14:18",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 239.257,
      "end": 242.415,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there cometh upon them again a spiritual death,",
      "verse": "14:18",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 242.595,
      "end": 244.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, a second death,",
      "verse": "14:18",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 244.447,
      "end": 248.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they are cut off again as to things pertaining to righteousness.",
      "verse": "14:18",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 249.26,
      "end": 251.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore repent ye, repent ye,",
      "verse": "14:19",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 251.576,
      "end": 254.455,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest by knowing these things and not doing them",
      "verse": "14:19",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 254.635,
      "end": 258.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall suffer yourselves to come under condemnation,",
      "verse": "14:19",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 258.205,
      "end": 261.456,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye are brought down unto this second death.",
      "verse": "14:19",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 262.136,
      "end": 266.687,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, as I said unto you concerning another sign, a sign of his death,",
      "verse": "14:20",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 266.867,
      "end": 269.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, in that day that he shall suffer death",
      "verse": "14:20",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 269.88,
      "end": 274.06,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the sun shall be darkened and refuse to give his light unto you;",
      "verse": "14:20",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 274.24,
      "end": 276.469,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also the moon and the stars;",
      "verse": "14:20",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 276.649,
      "end": 280.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there shall be no light upon the face of this land,",
      "verse": "14:20",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 280.219,
      "end": 284.631,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even from the time that he shall suffer death, for the space of three days,",
      "verse": "14:20",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 284.811,
      "end": 288.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the time that he shall rise again from the dead.",
      "verse": "14:20",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 288.835,
      "end": 291.529,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, at the time that he shall yield up the ghost",
      "verse": "14:21",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 291.709,
      "end": 296.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there shall be thunderings and lightnings for the space of many hours,",
      "verse": "14:21",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 296.533,
      "end": 299.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the earth shall shake and tremble;",
      "verse": "14:21",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 299.453,
      "end": 307.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the rocks which are upon the face of this earth, which are both above the earth and beneath,",
      "verse": "14:21",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 307.621,
      "end": 310.129,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which ye know at this time are solid,",
      "verse": "14:21",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 310.309,
      "end": 314.21,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the more part of it is one solid mass, shall be broken up;",
      "verse": "14:21",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 314.89,
      "end": 317.119,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, they shall be rent in twain,",
      "verse": "14:22",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 317.299,
      "end": 324.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall ever after be found in seams and in cracks, and in broken fragments upon the face of the whole earth,",
      "verse": "14:22",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 324.724,
      "end": 327.232,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, both above the earth and beneath.",
      "verse": "14:22",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 327.912,
      "end": 330.466,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, there shall be great tempests,",
      "verse": "14:23",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 330.646,
      "end": 334.64,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there shall be many mountains laid low, like unto a valley,",
      "verse": "14:23",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 334.82,
      "end": 339.092,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there shall be many places which are now called valleys",
      "verse": "14:23",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 339.272,
      "end": 342.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which shall become mountains, whose height is great.",
      "verse": "14:23",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 343.11,
      "end": 345.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And many highways shall be broken up,",
      "verse": "14:24",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 345.612,
      "end": 348.445,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many cities shall become desolate.",
      "verse": "14:24",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 349.125,
      "end": 351.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And many graves shall be opened,",
      "verse": "14:25",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 351.581,
      "end": 354.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall yield up many of their dead;",
      "verse": "14:25",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 354.408,
      "end": 356.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many saints shall appear unto many.",
      "verse": "14:25",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 357.596,
      "end": 360.336,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, thus hath the angel spoken unto me;",
      "verse": "14:26",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 360.516,
      "end": 362.049,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he said unto me",
      "verse": "14:26",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 362.229,
      "end": 366.827,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there should be thunderings and lightnings for the space of many hours.",
      "verse": "14:26",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 367.507,
      "end": 369.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto me",
      "verse": "14:27",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 369.22,
      "end": 375.118,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that while the thunder and the lightning lasted, and the tempest, that these things should be,",
      "verse": "14:27",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 375.298,
      "end": 380.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that darkness should cover the face of the whole earth for the space of three days.",
      "verse": "14:27",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 381.365,
      "end": 383.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the angel said unto me",
      "verse": "14:28",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 383.31,
      "end": 386.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that many shall see greater things than these,",
      "verse": "14:28",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 386.462,
      "end": 395.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the intent that they might believe that these signs and these wonders should come to pass upon all the face of this land,",
      "verse": "14:28",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 395.466,
      "end": 400.76,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the intent that there should be no cause for unbelief among the children of men\u2014",
      "verse": "14:28",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 401.44,
      "end": 405.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this to the intent that whosoever will believe might be saved,",
      "verse": "14:29",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 405.707,
      "end": 410.537,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that whosoever will not believe, a righteous judgment might come upon them;",
      "verse": "14:29",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 410.717,
      "end": 412.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also if they are condemned",
      "verse": "14:29",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 413.033,
      "end": 416.144,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they bring upon themselves their own condemnation.",
      "verse": "14:29",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 416.824,
      "end": 424.162,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now remember, remember, my brethren, that whosoever perisheth, perisheth unto himself;",
      "verse": "14:30",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 424.342,
      "end": 428.104,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whosoever doeth iniquity, doeth it unto himself;",
      "verse": "14:30",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 428.284,
      "end": 430.049,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, ye are free;",
      "verse": "14:30",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 430.229,
      "end": 432.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye are permitted to act for yourselves;",
      "verse": "14:30",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 432.824,
      "end": 437.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, God hath given unto you a knowledge and he hath made you free.",
      "verse": "14:30",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 437.962,
      "end": 441.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "He hath given unto you that ye might know good from evil,",
      "verse": "14:31",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 441.857,
      "end": 445.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he hath given unto you that ye might choose life or death;",
      "verse": "14:31",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 445.938,
      "end": 449.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye can do good and be restored unto that which is good,",
      "verse": "14:31",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 449.973,
      "end": 452.62,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or have that which is good restored unto you;",
      "verse": "14:31",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 452.8,
      "end": 454.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or ye can do evil,",
      "verse": "14:31",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 454.466,
      "end": 457.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have that which is evil restored unto you.",
      "verse": "14:31",
      "lineIndex": 127
    }
  ]
}